[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8761.11, "timestamp": "02:26:01", "text": "人们只会盯着看，而不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8763.91, "timestamp": "02:26:03", "text": "帮忙还是报警？你知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8767.429, "timestamp": "02:26:07", "text": "老兄，这里是印度啊。印度。是的。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8768.87, "timestamp": "02:26:08", "text": "他们会绕着身体走吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8772.23, "timestamp": "02:26:12", "text": "甚至。谁在乎？总之。是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8773.91, "timestamp": "02:26:13", "text": "它。谢谢你。谢谢你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8775.59, "timestamp": "02:26:15", "text": "游戏。感谢您参与游戏！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8779.67, "timestamp": "02:26:19", "text": "测验。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8781.59, "timestamp": "02:26:21", "text": "去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8783.75, "timestamp": "02:26:23", "text": "我以为我是个精神病患者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8787.19, "timestamp": "02:26:27", "text": "实际上，当你开始的时候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8789.67, "timestamp": "02:26:29", "text": "显然，你是最正常的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8793.429, "timestamp": "02:26:33", "text": "有。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8795.429, "timestamp": "02:26:35", "text": "有趣的。你不是精神病患者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8797.03, "timestamp": "02:26:37", "text": "那很好。你可能是一个反社会人格者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8798.79, "timestamp": "02:26:38", "text": "但这又是另一个故事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8800.23, "timestamp": "02:26:40", "text": "我们会为此制作一个视频。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8805.19, "timestamp": "02:26:45", "text": "确实。啊，那么，我该怎么做呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8808.15, "timestamp": "02:26:48", "text": "给你解释一下？喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8813.03, "timestamp": "02:26:53", "text": "一个类似夏洛克·福尔摩斯那样的罪犯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8814.469, "timestamp": "02:26:54", "text": "是的。是的。是的。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8817.429, "timestamp": "02:26:57", "text": "就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8819.51, "timestamp": "02:26:59", "text": "精神病患者就像疯子一样。他们"}]